    ATTACHSCANEP["POST /api/safety/attachment-scan<br/>EXPECTED BACKEND CONTRACT"]
  end

  CTXCLIENT -->|"admission lease check, fail-closed"| ADMISSIONCHECK
  CTXCLIENT -->|"unavailable -> SystemHealthPanel shows unavailable"| HEALTHEP
  CTXCLIENT --> HEARTBEATEP
  CTXCLIENT --> RELEASEEP
  CTXCLIENT --> RECOMMENDEP
